OL,3,AFour bodies found after avalanche hits
OL,4,AHimalayan climbing group
OL,5,
OL,6,FRescuers have recovered four bodies
OL,7,Ffrom the site of an avalanche that
OL,8,Fstruck a climbing group camping in the
OL,9,FNepalese part of the Himalayas.
OL,11,FA dozen people are still thought to be
OL,12,Fmissing after a sheet of snow fell on
OL,13,Fthe base camp of Himlung Himal peak on
OL,14,FManang district on Sunday morning.
OL,16,FThe group of Nepalese nationals,
OL,17,Fincluding climbers and support staff,
OL,18,Fhad been sent ahead of foreign climbers
OL,19,Fto prepare the camp and fix ropes.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
